    "detailed_description": "It is a puzzle-solving game where you solve a mystery with one-click operation, unlock a closed door, and escape from a vast and mysterious world.<br />\r\nA unique view of the world with the theme of space, mysterious graphics, and more than 20 BGM are recorded.<br />\r\nIf you clear to the end, you may get a glimpse of the big mystery of the world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLet's get out of this world by solving the items and gimmicks scattered in the mysterious world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Features\u3011<br />\r\n-Easy to start for first players<br />\r\n-The world of mysterious art and sound.<br />\r\n-Auto-save function<br />\r\n-Hints function.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010How to play\u3011<br />\r\n\u30fbLet's tap the part of the screen that interests you.<br />\r\n\u30fbTap the right and left buttons to swipe the window.<br />\r\n\u30fbTo check the hint from menu window.<br />\r\n\u30fbLight up the item. tap the gimmick, then you can use it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProgram,Sound KensukeHorikosshi<br />\r\nGraphic Taniguchi<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you like this game, please play other games!",
